{"id":"tseloe","lemma":"целое","pos":"noun","rank":2007,"glosses":["the whole","integer (whole number)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9c/Ru-%D1%86%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%86%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"целого","plural":"целые"},"examples":[{"text":"Это стоило мне целое состояние.","en":"It cost me a fortune.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to cost","l":"стоить"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"state"}]},{"text":"Том устал после целого дня работы.","en":"Tom is tired after working all day.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"after"},null,{"g":"day, daytime","l":"день"},{"g":"work","l":"работа"}]},{"text":"Моя бабушка оставила нам целое состояние.","en":"My grandmother left us a great fortune.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"grandmother"},{"g":"to leave","l":"оставить"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"state"}]},{"text":"Это, должно быть, стоило ему целое состояние.","en":"That must've cost him a fortune.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"it must be, probably"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"to cost","l":"стоить"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"он"},null,{"g":"state"}]},{"text":"Он слопал целое яблоко.","en":"He ate the whole apple.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null,{"g":"apple"}]}]}